# ex13 — sequenced-effects fixture (mirrors demos/2-effects/13-sequenced-effects.bqn)
# tint is the .bqn's `flash` column, renamed: the effect verb Flash cannot share its target column's name.
# Verb convention: dfn called once as sel Fn ⟨targetcol, args...⟩, returns the full new target column.
n 6
alias cursor 0 0 1 0 0 0
col pos num 0 10 20 30 40 50
col tint sym None None None None None None
col shielded bool 1 1 1 0 1 0
col nord bool 1 1 0 1 0 0
col twoHanded num 70 50 90 61 10 99
col gold num 5 10 15 20 25 30
col blessed bool 0 1 0 0 0 0
fn knockback pos {s 𝕊 c‿k: c+k×s}
fn flash tint {s 𝕊 c‿v: s‿((+´s)⥊v) AnoScat c}
